## Title: BetterBarsForever
## Notes: Clearer action buttons on WoW Forever: a red icon out of range, a blue icon without mana, big cooldown numbers (56, 2m, 1h; none for the global cooldown), short hotkeys (M4, N1, sc3) and optional macro names. Each part can be switched off. /bbars
